{
  "$comment": "Presentation metadata for each API operation. Behaviour (credits, async, input format) lives in openapi.json and is NEVER duplicated here — build.mjs merges the two and fails loudly if they disagree about which operations exist. Output samples for the employee list, profile info, company info and scalar families were CAPTURED FROM LIVE API CALLS on 2026-08-26; the remaining ones are still derived from documentation. Note that the API returns empty strings rather than nulls for missing profile fields.",
